        "id": 1010134
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-26T13:24:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see any reason why the API (or interfaces) cannot consume and return types defined in other plugins. IMO we should not limit the `ApiModules` only to JVM and Gerrit types.",
      "parentUuid": "90d33b7a_2db371fe",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 15,
        "endChar": 24
