      "message": "Well, only partially: the author of the plugin may be unaware of the deployment infrastructure at runtime.\n\nExample: as Open-Source contributor @maczech@gmail.com wrote the `pull-replication.jar` but he is unaware that client XYZ has a sync configuration with a CI/CD that needs to trigger *exactly* at `ref-updated` without delays.",
