      "writtenOn": "2024-04-26T13:24:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e client XYZ has a sync configuration with a CI/CD that needs to trigger *exactly* at `ref-updated` without delays.\n\nIsn\u0027t that expected by all of the Gerrit users? In the other words, would anyone complain if that would be a default behaviour, not a \"configuration dependant option\". If yes, I\u0027d argue that\u0027s a general feature request (or a bug) in the plugin, that should be fixed in the plugin code not in the instance setup.",
      "parentUuid": "375c7c11_44540122",
