      "writtenOn": "2024-04-26T13:24:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would rather encourage plugin authors to code their dependencies in the plugin code. We can expose API that provides a list of _enabled_ plugins and another event-based API to propagate (and listen for) information about plugin subsystems being successfully initiated.",
