      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-26T13:24:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a cheap way of removing one of the limitations of `ApiModule`, that they cannot depend on other `ApiModule`s. Simply adding proper ordering solves that problem. IMO, it\u0027s low hanging fruit that we can easily reach for.",
      "parentUuid": "a4e69603_47e14fcd",
